<<~ ahu #/meme-header>>

! The Context Substrate

Design in the open; the forks at #forks stand unruled.

''One VM, one grammar, four doors.'' The operator and the agent reach the same store
through the same engine, and context arrives ''by transclusion at an address'' rather than
by file-import as cargo. A `lar:` URI carries the reach; the daemon's TW5 VM renders it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ aka lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/RFC-2119#/normative-language>>

<<~ ahu #/provenance>>

